{"corpus":"ccc","number":474,"text_html":"<span>De par son union à la Sagesse divine en la personne du Verbe incarné, la connaissance humaine du Christ jouissait en plénitude de la science des desseins éternels qu’il était venu révéler <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. Ce qu’il reconnaît ignorer dans ce domaine <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup>, il déclare ailleurs n’avoir pas mission de le révéler <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">7</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":[],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mc 8:31"},{"text":"Mc 9:31"},{"text":"Mc 10:33-34"},{"text":"Mc 14:18-20"},{"text":"Mc 14:26-30"},{"text":"Mc 13:32"},{"text":"Ac 1:7"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 8:31","idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"9:31","idx":2,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"10:33-34","idx":3,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"14:18-20","idx":4,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"14:26-30","idx":5,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 13:32","idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ac 1:7","idx":7}]}